    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】@直布陀LUO</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】@七12 （某书同名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>好久不见家人们，因为我自己“工作的缘故”耽误了很久的这期播客终于和大家见面了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾邀请了一位“亦师亦友”！之所以这么说，在收听中你们一定能体会很多的”大智慧“！</span></p><span></span><p><span>两个人的聊天更像是采访，嘉宾讲述了她家庭和爱情的种种。</span></p><span></span><p><span>至于他是怎么经营这段甜美且持久的恋爱呢？我们一起听听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 单亲家庭带给“我”的成长和思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 接纳自己的过程中我也想过归结于我的“原生家庭”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> ”我每一段爱情都是**来的哦“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 对爱的思考“什么叫做我爱不爱你？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 小小“爱搞杀”一下！</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客粉丝群限时开放哦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlC2h6ny00hA0DTJJaIrIBizLBt7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPVGYOoQwU1mWDnvZuy8fpSAZso.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvVBRjQm-F3YX8NAKMTyLa085Ds.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
