  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 我在北京上海努力打拼不就是为回老家买房吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ac340b293471fed45f55d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ac340b293471fed45f55d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Aug 2025 10:02:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】@直布陀LUO、@池一</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】@chris、@小斌</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客是在我上个月回到北京和北京的朋友录制的</span></p><span></span><p><span>也赶上池一即将从北京搬家到上海的前夕</span></p><span></span><p><span>就录制了一期和北京上海对比敢想的播客内容</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家喜欢。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 当初来到北京的原因？为什么选择来到这个城市呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 教你一些“地道”的北京话！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> 在京合租趣闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 为什么在北京生活这么多年最后决定去上海了呢？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 北京本地人也会离开北京选择其他城市吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 北京爱情和好吃的？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 对“池一”的好友寄语！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 上海的电话本是传说中“标签化人”的样子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">37:26</a> 北京和上海哪个城市带给你的活人感更强呢？？</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客群已建立！欢迎各位听众扫码加入！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmpu0XnQYFBSvjPYdxGjj2izd2o4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FolkwWSP-3S54kP69vjCUatUe639.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvVBRjQm-F3YX8NAKMTyLa085Ds.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
